# R7 acceptance transcript: the performance corpus.
#
# R6 |- R7. Performance becomes evidence.
#
# The reference engine counts every comparison it makes; the indexed engine
# counts the questions it is asked; both must answer alike; and the factor
# between the two costs is a policy decided in Strata. The observation is a
# canonical value with an artifact name, so the performance claim is an
# artifact a foundation can pin rather than a sentence in a document.

